  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.78,
      "text": "We know AI is amazing, fantastic, and, well, you couldn't insert your own superlative right here."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.24,
      "end": 9.6,
      "text": "How much should you trust it when you're the one making a high-stakes decision?"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.04,
      "end": 13.1,
      "text": "Take a universally stressful choice, like picking a college."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.66,
      "end": 16.64,
      "text": "Let's test this by asking the exact same question twice."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.62,
      "end": 20.04,
      "text": "Once at the dinner table, and once in a chat window."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.6,
      "end": 22.1,
      "text": "Should I choose Michigan or Indiana?"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.44,
      "end": 24.16,
      "text": "On the left side, your mom says,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.66,
      "end": 26.54,
      "text": "Indiana, you seemed more comfortable there,"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.9,
      "end": 28.9,
      "text": "and when you get stuck, you tend to go quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.46,
      "end": 32.96,
      "text": "Being somewhere you'll ask for help matters more for you than another ranking."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.36,
      "end": 36.98,
      "text": "She actually knows you, and holds a personal stake in your future happiness."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.34,
      "end": 38.94,
      "text": "The chatbot responds, Michigan."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.54,
      "end": 42.3,
      "text": "It offers world-class academics and a vibrant campus community."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.76,
      "end": 44.16,
      "text": "It could be an excellent fit for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.56,
      "end": 47.26,
      "text": "The chatbot only knows what you typed into the prompt box."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.62,
      "end": 51.58,
      "text": "It has never seen how you act when you're stuck, overwhelmed, or struggling."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.94,
      "end": 53.94,
      "text": "It has no stake in which school you choose."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.42,
      "end": 55.28,
      "text": "Which one would you trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.28,
      "end": 60.96,
      "text": "The AI's response is confident, highly polished, and incredibly easy to like."
    }
  ],
